{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S02、S04、S11等段的感受提示有些密集，部分比喻叠加过多，容易抢走叙事注意力；S13也略微削弱了Y中“明知没人能保证永远”的明确心理动机。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X更容易让普通观众边听边抓住重点：【】直接标出了人物此刻最重要的念头、顾虑和变化，感受文字较小且按音乐节点出现，减少了同时处理大量信息的压力。它不仅告诉观众人物高兴、害怕或舍不得，还用呼吸、声线、水波、光线、身体失重等具体变化呈现情绪如何发生，水面、船与波浪等意象也让前后段落形成连续感。Y的优势是叙事比较舒展、感受词不那么繁复，但缺少重点提示，右侧短词与人物心理之间有时只是并列关系，观众需要自己多做一步理解。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "68118ad4-c3c8-4569-b5ac-190cfde10519", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T230453007456Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:06:11.403154+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "364767346f52be67779e2bfb7b0128fd87dc5cc0e0541159b71a68992e52f525", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a